  "instructions": [
    "Trim the ends off the green beans. Mince the garlic, and chop the shallot.",
    "Add the sesame oil to a large skillet over medium to medium-high heat. Let heat for a couple minutes until hot.",
    "Carefully add the shallot and garlic. Heat for 20-30 seconds.",
    "Add the green beans and stir well to coat. Sauté until just tender, about 5-6 minutes, stirring often so the garlic doesn't burn.",
    "Add the teriyaki sauce. Toss to combine and cook 1-2 minutes.",
    "When serving, don't forget the garlic/shallot pieces on the bottom of the pan — huge flavor!"
  ],
